WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
An agent needs a plan. And clear boundaries.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The hard part is coordinating the work.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Make the task concrete before execution.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Divide the work. Keep a shared plan.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Your team sets the boundaries.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Start with work your team needs done.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Your team decides what happens next.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Start with one reviewable task.
